.el .ds Aq '
.TH sam-jail-config 1 2026-11-23 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-config \- Read or change configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read or change configuration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sam\-jail\-config\-show(1)
Print the whole configuration
.TP
sam\-jail\-config\-get(1)
Print one setting (for example extraction.max_files)
.TP
sam\-jail\-config\-set(1)
Change one setting
.TP
sam\-jail\-config\-put(1)
Replace the whole configuration from JSON on stdin
.TP
sam\-jail\-config\-path(1)
Print where SAM keeps its configuration, data and logs
